{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173237-heirs-to-hell-errata-thread","id":173237,"title":"Heirs to Hell errata thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-18T15:21:35-07:00","id":173237,"title":"Heirs to Hell errata thread","content":"If you find any typos or visual glitches in <i>Heirs to Hell</i>, let us know here so that we can fix them. Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T15:38:54-07:00","id":173264,"title":"","content":"... I thought <i>Flowers of Hell </i>was what was coming out this week. And that doesn't seem to be on DRPG.<br /> <br /> I checked my Kickstarter page and no cigar either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T15:49:06-07:00","id":173277,"title":"","content":"Neither of them are up. Something goofed?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T15:55:44-07:00","id":173280,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173237-heirs-to-hell-errata-thread?p=173277#post173277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Neither of them are up. Something goofed?</div> </div> </div> </div>Message from Kickstarter that I literally just got the download link from.<br /> <br /> Missing word on first page of intro fiction: &quot;Or, rather, the second hand skipped, <b>it had just about to </b>land on the seven[\u2026]&quot;<br /> <br /> Typo on third page of intro fiction, &quot;A man and <b>women</b>, identical-looking twins[\u2026]&quot;<br /> <br /> Typo on fifth page of intro fiction, &quot;The twins moved around her, one standing on <b>other</b> side[\u2026]&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 06-18-2014, 07:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T16:09:57-07:00","id":173291,"title":"","content":"Page 12: &quot;the stories about <b>are</b> people who cannot&quot;<br /> <br /> Page 22: &quot;This is when most Fracticals <b>who</b> get exposed to the Machine.&quot; <br /> <br /> I'll edit this post if I notice new typos.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":54,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","user":"Tiresias","date":". 06-18-2014, 07:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T16:13:33-07:00","id":173292,"title":"","content":"$100 backer waiting on an email over here. Anyone else?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T16:46:47-07:00","id":173331,"title":"","content":"I believe Rich Thomas has to go down each individual qualifying reward tier and send the email out to those lists separately? If so, that might have to do with why people haven't gotten it yet.<br /> <br /> PDF Bookmark: Introduction -&gt; <b>Why Heirs to Hell? </b>Question mark is listed as an unprinted unicode character in the bookmark text.<br /> PDF Bookmark: Introduction -&gt; <b>Inspiration</b> is listed as a subsection of Why Heirs to Hell? instead of its own section.<br /> p. 12: &quot;but then again, <b>It</b> might regard them as just&quot; (this might be intentional, since it refers to the God-Machine, but it's a tic the line doesn't use elsewhere that I noticed).<br /> p. 15: &quot;Your mother <b>didn't die a car accident</b>&quot; Missing preposition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T16:59:14-07:00","id":173341,"title":"","content":"The book will be out to all Kickstarter backers soon. As Stupid Loserman says, Rich has to download the Excel spreadsheet for each reward tier, grab the addresses, and go through DriveThru's tools to send out the message. I put up the thread when he started.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:18:30-07:00","id":173366,"title":"","content":"p. 21: &quot;<b>Demons, the Fall, the God-Machine are</b> a distant genetic memory&quot; Missing conjunction.<br /> p. 21: &quot;their Offspring are often <b>able observe</b> their <b>parents</b> behavior&quot; Missing &quot;to,&quot; missing apostrophe.<br /> p. 21: &quot;All the rest of a child's time <b>is</b> spent discovering the world is comparing their tests&quot; Extraneous &quot;is.&quot;<br /> p. 22: &quot;This is when most Fractals <b>who</b> get exposed to the Machine.&quot; Extraneous &quot;who.&quot;<br /> p. 23: &quot;an education intended to <b>teach them master</b> their abilities&quot; Missing &quot;to.&quot;<br /> p. 24 &quot;easier, for example<b>; One</b> with Just Bruised&quot; Either miscapitalized or erroneous semicolon.<br /> p. 24 &quot;even if they avoid <b>Its</b> scrutiny&quot; Another inconsistent capitalized God-Machine pronoun.<br /> p. 25 &quot;capture <b>Its</b> wayward servant, but <b>It</b> will also take that opportunity to draw the demon-blooded deeper into <b>Its</b> schemes.&quot; Same, thrice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:37:26-07:00","id":173385,"title":"","content":"Apologies for being petulant upthread; I was afraid it had been a mass e-mail and I'd been missed! The book looks good so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:46:37-07:00","id":173390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173237-heirs-to-hell-errata-thread?p=173341#post173341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The book will be out to all Kickstarter backers soon. As Stupid Loserman says, Rich has to download the Excel spreadsheet for each reward tier, grab the addresses, and go through DriveThru's tools to send out the message. I put up the thread when he started.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is the book going to available to poorfolk who didn't have the cash to throw during the kickstarter soon?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:55:31-07:00","id":173395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173237-heirs-to-hell-errata-thread?p=173390#post173390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is the book going to available to poorfolk who didn't have the cash to throw during the kickstarter soon?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes. All of our books are available to non-backers. Backers just get stretch goal books earlier.<br /> <br /> <br /> Let's move questions about <i>Heirs</i> and KS stuff to a separate thread, so that this one will be easier for us to sort through when we're doing corrections. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:09:29-07:00","id":173482,"title":"","content":"p. 20: An Offspring Learns to Cheat; <b>&quot;She willed Trick of Light to manifest&quot;</b>, should probably be Trick of the Light.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T02:52:24-07:00","id":173910,"title":"","content":"p. 17: &quot;Offspring are born stigmatic, which means they have the <b>Merit</b>: Unseen Sense - God-Machine <b>Merit ...&quot;</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1488-skeltem","name":"Skeltem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T16:48:22-07:00","id":174696,"title":"","content":"p. 42: &quot;She gains an additional <b>a </b>+1Wits and Composure rolls during this trimester.&quot; Also 'to' is missing between '+1' and 'Wits'.<br /> p. 43: &quot;<b>They</b> authorities told her that her Dad died from an overdose.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":1329,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","user":"ElvesofZion","date":". 06-19-2014, 08:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T01:41:31-07:00","id":175064,"title":"","content":"No specific citation, but there's contradictory info about Latents: ch. 1 indicates that Latents are basically regular humans - mechanically speaking, only having the Integrity and maaaybe Compromise traits - until they experience something that would make them Stigmatic, which gives them Stigmata and Unseen Sense: G-M along with the rest of the traits for Offspring. Character generation instead says that every Latent is essentially a full Stigmatic until they have a chance to become Offspring. Pretty big difference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T10:10:38-07:00","id":175328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kirby Jerusalem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/173237-heirs-to-hell-errata-thread?p=175064#post175064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No specific citation, but there's contradictory info about Latents: ch. 1 indicates that Latents are basically regular humans - mechanically speaking, only having the Integrity and maaaybe Compromise traits - until they experience something that would make them Stigmatic, which gives them Stigmata and Unseen Sense: G-M along with the rest of the traits for Offspring. Character generation instead says that every Latent is essentially a full Stigmatic until they have a chance to become Offspring. Pretty big difference.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I believe the idea is that ch.1 is referring to the entire lifespan of the Latent, whereas character generation assumes you are playing one that is post-stigmatic event. Otherwise youd just play a mortal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T14:59:06-07:00","id":175557,"title":"","content":"Mm. If that were the case then they wouldn't be giving you Latent as a character choice, because you'd just be playing an Offspring. No, the text clearly states that Latents get the core demon-blooded package, and the sample character later backs that up by giving her Stigmata.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T17:07:51-07:00","id":175641,"title":"","content":"I believe I got my impression from this bit in ch.1:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Any event that would cause as Latent to become a stigmatic, however, wakes his demon blood and makes him an Offspring instead. Even then, they're indistinguishable from other stigmatics until they start manifesting Embeds,... </div> </div> </div>When I then read the character gen section I took it as making a post stigmatic event but pre-Embed character. Looking at it again though, that is a rather minimal difference that I am not sure I am happy with either.<br /> <br /> Edit: And looking at it even more, it says this in the character generation section:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If, during play, a Latent character experiences an event that would cause a normal human to become stigmatic, the character becomes an Offspring instead. She immediately develops an Embed... </div> </div> </div>So, I retract everything I said. You are correct Kirby, it is completely contradictory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":1329,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","user":"ElvesofZion","date":". 06-20-2014, 08:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T17:43:08-07:00","id":175657,"title":"","content":"Unless I missed something, I don't think the book ever goes into how a demon-blooded learns Embeds other than it's initial Embed and the ones learned through the Cipher, nor what it would cost to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T22:11:09-07:00","id":175775,"title":"","content":"p.31 &quot;During character creation, the player should answer the following five questions. The questions are similar to the compromise questions for demon characters, found on p. 113 of Demon: The Descent).&quot; -- No open bracket.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T23:29:26-07:00","id":175824,"title":"","content":"<u>Partial Wrong Word</u> - p. 34 last sentence of second to last paragraph: &quot;...to live and die with ever completing a single Interlock.&quot; Should probably be &quot;...to live and die with<b>out</b> ever completing a single Interlock.<br /> <br /> <u>Uncapitalize?</u> - p. 35 last sentence of first paragraph under Cipher Conditions: &quot;...moving slowly to the point that It can activate and use her for Its most sensitive and complex machinations.&quot; Though pronouns are often capitalized for deities, that is not the convention in most of the book and <i>Demon: the Descent</i>.<br /> <br /> Haven't had a chance to read much yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1925-toroid","name":"Toroid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1925_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T08:24:20-07:00","id":181972,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u>PDF bookmarks</u> - In Chapter 2, in the Special Systems section, all the systems are child bookmarks of Ambient Aether instead of being siblings.<br /> <br /> <u>Compound Word</u> - p. 23 above Exploited Offspring, left-hand column, 5th line from the bottom: &quot;Literature and media often depict the image of hell spawn&quot; The convention used several places elsewhere in the book is to have it as all one word. &quot;Literature and media often depict the image of <b>hellspawn</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> <u>Missing Comma</u> - p. 23 last sentence before the Exploited Offspring header: &quot;For some it means reveling in the shadow....&quot; Needs a comma between &quot;some&quot; and &quot;it&quot; to make it, &quot;For some, it means reveling in the shadow...&quot;<br /> <br /> <u>Wrong word?</u> - p. 24 third sentence after All Grown Up: &quot;Others fall in with dangerous crowds, trading on their special abilities until their luck runs out.&quot; Seems like &quot;banking on&quot; was the intended phrase. &quot;Others fall in with dangerous crowds, <b>banking</b> on their special abilities until their luck runs out.&quot;<br /> <br /> <u>Suggested Substitution</u> - p. 41 last sentence in the &quot;Gender and Pregnancy&quot; sidebar: &quot;...from having a demon-blooded child is that the player doesn\u2019t want to tell that story.&quot; I feel like replacing 'that' with 'if' would sound less like the decision was already made for the player. It would read, &quot;...from having a demon-blooded child is <b>if</b> the player doesn\u2019t want to tell that story.&quot;<br /> <br /> At first I thought that including the Integrity section under Special Systems felt really out of place because it's supposed to be the new default system and because it just didn't fit sandwiched in amongst all the descriptions of supernatural systems. Then I noticed that Integrity wasn't in Demon: the Descent's Appendix II so from the perspective of people with only the WoD rulebook and Demon, it sort of is a special system. So, though I feel like it might fit better down in the Character Creation section of Chapter 2, I can't really blame you for leaving it as is.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1925,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1925-toroid","user":"Toroid","date":".  Made the font and size constant 06-27-2014, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1925-toroid","name":"Toroid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1925_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T06:45:40-07:00","id":196741,"title":"","content":"Thread closed. Thanks for your contributions, everyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}